{
  "$schema": "https://docs.renovatebot.com/renovate-schema.json",
  "extends": [
    "config:base"
  ],
  "description": "Renovate configuration for Black Duck vulnerability remediation",
  "dependencyDashboard": true,
  "dependencyDashboardAutoclose": false,
  "enabledManagers": ["gomod", "npm", "docker-compose", "dockerfile", "regex"],
  "ignorePresets": [":prHourlyLimit2"],
  "prHourlyLimit": 0,
  "prConcurrentLimit": 0,
  "branchConcurrentLimit": 0,
  "separateMinorPatch": true,
  "separateMultipleMajor": true,
  "separateMajorMinor": true,
  "rangeStrategy": "update-lockfile",
  "semanticCommits": "enabled",
  "commitMessagePrefix": "fix(deps):",
  "commitMessageTopic": "{{depName}}",
  "commitMessageExtra": "to {{#if isMajor}}v{{{newMajor}}}{{else}}{{#if isSingleVersion}}v{{{newVersion}}}{{else}}{{{newValue}}}{{/if}}{{/if}}",
  "labels": [
    "dependencies",
    "security"
  ],
  "assignees": [],
  "reviewers": [],
  "vulnerabilityAlerts": {
    "enabled": false
  },
  "regexManagers": [
    {
      "fileMatch": ["^image_versions\\.json$"],
      "matchStrings": [
        "\"(?<depName>[^\"]+)\":\\s*\\{[^}]*\"tag\":\\s*\"(?<currentValue>[^\"]+)\""
      ],
      "datasourceTemplate": "docker",
      "versioningTemplate": "docker"
    }
  ],
  "packageRules": [
    {
      "description": "Disable all updates by default - only Black Duck findings will be enabled",
      "matchPackagePatterns": ["*"],
      "matchManagers": ["gomod", "npm"],
      "enabled": false
    },
    {
      "description": "Enable Docker updates for vulnerable base images",
      "matchManagers": ["docker-compose", "dockerfile"],
      "matchPackageNames": ["nginx", "postgres", "redis", "node", "golang"],
      "enabled": true
    },
    {
      "description": "Black Duck - gin CVE fixes (HIGH + MEDIUM)",
      "matchDatasources": ["go"],
      "matchPackageNames": ["github.com/gin-gonic/gin"],
      "enabled": true,
      "allowedVersions": ">=1.9.1",
      "groupName": "gin security updates",
      "separateMinorPatch": false,
      "prTitle": "fix(security): update gin to v1.9.1 to fix CVE-2023-29401 and CVE-2023-26125",
      "prBodyNotes": [
        "### 🔒 Security Update - Black Duck Finding (GO)",
        "",
        "This PR fixes multiple vulnerabilities in github.com/gin-gonic/gin:",
        "",
        "#### CVE-2023-29401 (HIGH)",
        "- **Severity**: HIGH (CVSS 7.5)",
        "- **Description**: Directory traversal vulnerability in gin-gonic/gin allows attackers to access files outside the intended directory",
        "",
        "#### CVE-2023-26125 (MEDIUM)",
        "- **Severity**: MEDIUM (CVSS 5.3)",
        "- **Description**: Denial of service vulnerability through malformed requests in gin-gonic/gin",
        "",
        "**Current Version**: 1.8.0",
        "**Fixed Version**: 1.9.1 (minimum safe version)",
        "",
        "**Remediation**: Update github.com/gin-gonic/gin to version 1.9.1 or later.",
        "",
        "---",
        "",
        "### 👥 Reviewers",
        "",
        "The following reviewers have been automatically assigned based on component ownership:",
        "",
        "- alice@company.com (API Gateway - Primary)",
        "- architects@company.com (Default - Secondary)",
        "- bob@company.com (API Gateway - Secondary)",
        "- charlie@company.com (API Gateway - Secondary)",
        "- david@company.com (Authentication Service - Primary)",
        "",
        "**Components Affected:** 8 total",
        "- API Gateway",
        "- Authentication Service",
        "- Contrib Plugin A",
        "- Contrib Plugin B",
        "- Default",
        "- Payment Processing",
        "- Shared Utilities",
        "- User Management",
        "",
        "---",
        "",
        "This PR was created based on Black Duck security scan findings."
      ],
      "labels": [
        "security",
        "high-priority",
        "blackduck",
        "cve-2023-29401",
        "cve-2023-26125",
        "go"
      ],
      "reviewers": [
        "alice@company.com",
        "architects@company.com",
        "bob@company.com",
        "charlie@company.com",
        "david@company.com"
      ],
      "addLabels": [
        "component:api-gateway",
        "component:authentication-service",
        "component:contrib-plugin-a"
      ]
    },
    {
      "description": "Black Duck - axios CVE-2021-3749 (HIGH)",
      "matchDatasources": ["npm"],
      "matchPackageNames": ["axios"],
      "enabled": true,
      "allowedVersions": ">=1.6.0",
      "groupName": null,
      "separateMinorPatch": false,
      "prTitle": "fix(security): update axios to v1.6.0 to fix CVE-2021-3749 (HIGH)",
      "prBodyNotes": [
        "### 🔒 Security Update - Black Duck Finding (NPM)",
        "",
        "**Vulnerability**: CVE-2021-3749",
        "**Severity**: HIGH (CVSS 7.5)",
        "**Ecosystem**: npm",
        "**Current Version**: 0.21.1",
        "**Fixed Version**: 1.6.0 (minimum safe version)",
        "",
        "**Description**: Server-Side Request Forgery (SSRF) vulnerability in axios allows attackers to perform unauthorized requests",
        "",
        "**Remediation**: Update axios to version 1.6.0 or later.",
        "",
        "---",
        "",
        "### 👥 Reviewers",
        "",
        "The following reviewers have been automatically assigned based on component ownership:",
        "",
        "- adam@company.com (Admin Dashboard - Secondary)",
        "- blake@company.com (Analytics Plugin - Primary)",
        "- clara@company.com (Analytics Plugin - Secondary)",
        "- xavier@company.com (Web Frontend - Primary)",
        "- yvonne@company.com (Web Frontend - Secondary)",
        "",
        "**Components Affected:** 3 total",
        "- Analytics Plugin",
        "- Admin Dashboard",
        "- Web Frontend",
        "",
        "---",
        "",
        "This PR was created based on Black Duck security scan findings."
      ],
      "labels": [
        "security",
        "high-priority",
        "blackduck",
        "cve-2021-3749",
        "npm"
      ],
      "reviewers": [
        "adam@company.com",
        "blake@company.com",
        "clara@company.com",
        "xavier@company.com",
        "yvonne@company.com"
      ],
      "addLabels": [
        "component:analytics-plugin",
        "component:admin-dashboard",
        "component:web-frontend"
      ]
    },
